`src/vdb.rs` reads the SQLite databases of the model (`gardener.db` and `extra-embeddings.db`), read only,
with the crate `rusqlite` 0.43.0 (MIT). Its feature `bundled` compiles SQLite 3.54.1, the file `sqlite3.c`
of the crate `libsqlite3-sys` 0.40.0 (MIT), into the program.

SQLite is in the Public domain: the authors have dedicated the code to the public domain, so no notice has to
stay with a copy. The blessing that stands in place of a legal notice in the SQLite source reads:

  May you do good and not evil.
  May you find forgiveness for yourself and forgive others.
  May you share freely, never taking more than you give.
